---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { legal } from "../data/legal";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms for using Rancher's website, indicative data-value calculator, and partnership inquiry and booking tools."
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Use govern your use of the {legal.operator} website and its
    tools. By using the website, you agree to these terms to the extent
    permitted by applicable law. If you do not agree, please do not use the
    website.
  </p>

  <h2>About this website</h2>
  <p>
    The website provides information about potential business-data licensing and
    tools for exploring a possible partnership. Service descriptions describe a
    proposed offering. They do not establish a customer relationship, promise
    that a dataset is eligible, or constitute an offer to buy or license data.
  </p>
  <p>
    Any actual partnership requires separate written terms addressing the
    parties, scope, rights, permitted uses, safeguards, delivery, and payment.
    Using this website or submitting an inquiry does not transfer ownership of
    your data or grant a license to it.
  </p>

  <h2>Calculator estimates</h2>
  <p>
    The calculator provides an indicative benchmark based on the public
    Handshake AI calculator reviewed on September 12, 2026. It uses modeled
    assumptions about company size, available history, and region. Source
    attribution does not imply an affiliation with or endorsement by Handshake
    or any other company.
  </p>
  <p>
    The displayed figures are not verified transaction prices, an appraisal,
    financial or legal advice, or a guarantee of earnings. They are not an offer
    from Rancher or the benchmark provider. Actual value may be zero and depends
    on the records, licensing rights, sensitivity, quality, preparation, demand,
    and negotiated terms.
  </p>
  <p>
    The calculator uses fixed input limits and display rules. A plus sign
    indicates an open-ended category, not an independently assessed value for
    every company in that category. Public benchmark assumptions may change. Do
    not rely on an estimate alone when making a commercial decision.
  </p>

  <h2>Partnership inquiries and booking</h2>
  <p>
    The inquiry form submits your contact details, business summary, outreach
    consent, and any selected calculator scenario to Rancher. You are
    responsible for the accuracy of your entries and for having permission to
    disclose them. Do not submit credentials, sensitive business records, or
    personal information about other people.
  </p>
  <p>
    After a submission is saved, you will be redirected to a calendar-booking
    service. You must complete that service's booking process to arrange a
    meeting. Submitting a form or scheduling a meeting is not an offer to
    license data, a guarantee of eligibility, or a contractual licensing
    commitment.
  </p>
  <p>
    The booking service operates under its own terms and availability. If saving
    an inquiry fails, the website displays an error and does not redirect you to
    the calendar.
  </p>

  <h2>Permitted use</h2>
  <p>
    You may use the website and its tools for lawful evaluation of a potential
    data partnership. Do not use the site to mislead others, infringe another
    person's rights, introduce malicious code, disrupt its operation, or attempt
    unauthorized access to systems or information.
  </p>

  <h2>Website content and third-party materials</h2>
  <p>
    Website text, designs, and artwork may be protected by intellectual-property
    rights held by Rancher or their respective owners. You may view the site and
    use its tools for your own business evaluation. These terms do not grant
    ownership of site content or permission to represent yourself as Rancher.
  </p>
  <p>
    Third-party names and marks belong to their owners. References to platforms
    illustrate potential data sources; they do not establish integrations,
    customer relationships, or endorsements. External websites are governed by
    their own terms, and Rancher is not responsible for their content or
    availability.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains how this website
    handles calculator inputs, inquiry submissions, and technical information
    associated with visiting the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Availability and limitations</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by applicable law, the website and its tools are
    provided as available, without a warranty that they will be uninterrupted,
    error-free, current, or suitable for a particular purpose. Features and
    content may be corrected, changed, or discontinued.
  </p>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by applicable law, Rancher is not liable for
    indirect or consequential losses, including lost profits or opportunities,
    arising from use of this informational website or reliance on its estimates.
    Nothing in these terms excludes liability or limits rights that cannot
    lawfully be excluded or limited.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes and separate agreements</h2>
  <p>
    We may revise these terms as the website changes. Updated terms will appear
    on this page with a revised date and apply to subsequent use to the extent
    permitted by law. A separate signed agreement governs any actual data
    partnership and takes precedence over these website terms if they conflict
    on that partnership.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
